# Notes, sorted.
note mcuboot/zephyr/.config: uses the PSA Crypto API (CONFIG_MBEDTLS_PSA_CRYPTO_C)
note mcuboot/zephyr/.config:525: CONFIG_MBEDTLS_HMAC_DRBG_C enables HMAC-DRBG, which the algorithm catalogue does not list yet; not reported
